{"title":"Berry/2","sourceTitle":"Berry/2/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Berries</b> são os <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fruit\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fruit\">fruit</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fruit\" title=\"Fruit\"> </a></span> dos arbustos de bagas, também conhecidos como arbustos frutíferos<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, encontrados em todos os biomas, exceto no deserto. As bagas são frescas por um curto período de tempo e fornecem frutos <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Satiety\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Satiety\">satiety</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\"> </a></span> quando consumidas.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">assets\\survival\\blocktypes\\plant\\fruitingbush.json</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115804\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 254/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 72/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 155/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.960      1 -total\n 47.45%    0.930      2 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183787-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115804 and revision id 397406. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397406,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at